1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
Guys, I'm taking this call real quick.
Keep playing.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,560
Yeah, hurry back.
What's wrong with you?

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:10,000
Yeah yeah, I'll be right back—
be right back— be right back—

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,920
Okay—

5
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:22,560
Come on, come on!
Damn, you sure eat a lot.

6
00:00:27,359 --> 00:00:32,520
I'm just out with friends.

7
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:38,399
At a club downtown.

8
00:00:38,399 --> 00:00:42,040
My classmates.

9
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:50,120
I don't know—
I might crash in someone's room.

10
00:00:57,760 --> 00:00:59,879
Ah—

11
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:16,880
Hey—

12
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:20,159
What's up?

13
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:26,040
Um… If I get drunk,
can you take me home?

14
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:28,933
Where? To Kan's place?

15
00:01:28,933 --> 00:01:34,750
Are you crazy? To your room, obviously.
I don't want to go back to P'Kan's.

16
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:36,799
What?

17
00:01:36,979 --> 00:01:41,460
- You scared he'll yell at you?
- No.

18
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:44,440
I just don't want to go.

19
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,440
Alright, alright.

20
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:55,099
Dance a bit.
